<title>POLAND: Unibud Q2 net rises to PLN 0.9 mln.</title>
<headline>Unibud Q2 net rises to PLN 0.9 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unibud preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997	Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			1.53  vs    1.28</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  1.4   vs    1.16</p>
<p>    net profit				0.87  vs    0.31</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Unibud SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				 19.41 vs    15.39</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  18.39 vs    11.29</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		  0.02  vs    0.0</p>
<p>    income tax				0.53  vs    0.84</p>
<p>    other taxes			     0.0   vs    0.0</p>
<p>    financial revenues		    0.08  vs    0.01</p>
<p>    financial costs			 0.14  vs    0.22</p>
<p>    investment				1.21  vs    0.62</p>
<p>						H1 1997	H1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			3.78  vs    2.27</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  3.56  vs    2.09</p>
<p>    net profit				2.45  vs    0.85</p>
<p>    net sales				 34.28 vs    30.22</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  31.61 vs    25.11</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		  0.01  vs    0.0</p>
<p>    income tax				1.11  vs    1.24</p>
<p>    other taxes			     0.0   vs    0.0</p>
<p>    financial revenues		    0.14  vs    0.02</p>
<p>    financial costs			 0.37  vs    0.21</p>
<p>    investment				2.05  vs    0.91</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
